;# Actions&apos; then sum([actions])&#10;WHEN &apos;# Break Until End of Shift&apos; then sum([break_until_end_of_shift])&#10;WHEN &apos;Break Duration (mins)&apos; then [Calculation_1309632734714478592]&#10;END' />
