en [Calculation_2691041549254467597]&#10;WHEN &apos;# Actions&apos; then [Calculation_2691041549254467597]&#10;WHEN &apos;# Break Until End of Shift&apos; then -[Calculation_2691041549254467597]&#10;WHEN &apos;Break Duration (mins)&apos; then - [Calculation_2691041549254467597]&#10;END'>
